{"acronym":null,"arm_groups":[{"intervention_names":["Drug: Dapagliflozin","Drug: Metformin XR"],"label":"Dapagliflozin + Metformin XR","type":"EXPERIMENTAL"},{"intervention_names":["Drug: Dapagliflozin","Drug: metformin HCl Modified Release matching Placebo"],"label":"Dapagliflozin + Placebo","type":"EXPERIMENTAL"},{"intervention_names":["Drug: Metformin XR","Drug: dapagliflozin matching Placebo"],"label":"Metformin XR + Placebo","type":"ACTIVE_COMPARATOR"}],"brief_summary":"The primary purpose of this study is to compare the change from baseline in hemoglobin A1C achieved with dapagliflozin 10 mg in combination with metformin XR as compared with metformin XR monotherapy and compared with Dapagliflozin monotherapy, after 24 weeks of oral administration of double-blind treatment. The safety of treatment with dapagliflozin will also be assessed in this study","brief_title":"Study of Dapagliflozin in Combination With Metformin XR to Initiate the Treatment of Type 2 Diabetes","collaborators":["Bristol-Myers Squibb"],"completion_date":{"date":"2010-05","type":"ACTUAL"},"conditions":["Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus"],"design":{"allocation":"RANDOMIZED","intervention_model":"PARALLEL","masking":"QUADRUPLE","primary_purpose":"TREATMENT","who_masked":["PARTICIPANT","CARE_PROVIDER","INVESTIGATOR","OUTCOMES_ASSESSOR"]},"eligibility":{"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Treatment naive males and females, \\>= 18 years old and\n\n\\<= 77 years old, with type 2 diabetes mellitus\n\n* Subjects must have central laboratory pre-randomization hemoglobin A1C \\>= 7.5 and \\<= 12.0%\n* C-peptide \\>= 1.0 ng/mL (0.34 nmol/L)\n* Body Mass Index \\<= 45 kg/m2\n* Must be able to perform self monitoring of blood glucose\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* aspartate aminotransferase (AST) and/or alanine aminotransferase (ALT) \\>3X\\*upper limit of normal (ULN)\n* Serum Total bilirubin \\>2 mg/dL (34.2 µmol/L)\n* Creatinine kinase \\>3\\*ULN\n* Serum creatinine \\>= 1.50 mg/dL (133 µmol/L) for male subj